Most warlocks use Voidwalkers because their **Torment** and **Suffering** abilities generate significantly more threat than the Succubus's **Lash of Pain**, making them far more effective at keeping mobs engaged during high-level content. Additionally, Voidwalkers provide superior **out-of-combat regeneration** via **Consume Shadows** and better **survival** through **Sacrifice**, whereas the Succubus is primarily optimized for leveling and questing due to its **Soothing Kiss** and **Lash of Pain**. [end of text]


